Scenario: View Default Notifications Portlet Delivery Options
Priority: 3
	Given Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Notifications|
	When NotificationsPortlet goto Notification Delivery
	And IFrame select Configuration Frame
	Then NotificationsPortlet view Default Notification Deliveries
Scenario: View No Notification
Priority: 5
	Given Notifications view No Notifications
		|activePanel|Profile|
	When ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|Notifications|
	And Notifications view No Request
	Then Notifications view No Notification Entry